  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nLet's interchange the given mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs and to balance the given equation.\n\n1) +, -, =, ÷\n\n⇒ 64 + 140 - 2 = __**4 ÷ 10**__\n\n⇒ __**64 + 140**__ - 2 = 0.4\n\n⇒ **__204 - 2 __**= 0.4\n\n⇒ 202 ≠ 0.4\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2) =, ÷, -, +\n\n⇒ 64 = __**140 ÷ 2**__ - 4 + 10\n\n⇒ 64 = __**70**__ - 4 __**+ 10**__\n\n⇒ 64 = __**80 - 4 **__\n\n⇒ 64 ≠ 76\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3) -, +, ÷, =\n\n⇒ 64 - 140 + __**2 ÷ 4**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**64 **__- 140 __**+ 0.5 **__= 10\n\n⇒ __**64.5 - 140**__ = 10\n\n⇒ - 75.5 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) =, ÷, +, -\n\n⇒ 64 = __**140 ÷ 2 **__+ 4 - 10\n\n⇒ 64 = __**70 + 4**__ - 10\n\n⇒ 64 = __**74 - 10**__\n\n⇒ 64 = 64\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"=, ÷, +, -\".**",
